CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BillDoesWhateverForRareMons::
    .string "That BILL!\p"
    .string "I heard that he'll do whatever it\n"
    .string "takes to get rare POKéMON.\p"
    .string "He's not above doing all sorts\n"
    .string "of things, I've heard.$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_EveryoneCallsBillPokemaniac::
    .string "Have you heard about BILL?\p"
    .string "Everyone calls him a POKéMANIAC!\p"
    .string "I think people are just jealous of\n"
    .string "BILL, though.\p"
    .string "Who wouldn't want to boast about\n"
    .string "their POKéMON?$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BillCollectsRareMons::
    .string "BILL has lots of POKéMON!\n"
    .string "He collects rare ones, too!$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TryTradingUpstairs::
    .string "Why don't you go upstairs and try\n"
    .string "trading POKéMON with your friends?\p"
    .string "You could get a lot more variety\n"
    .string "by trading.\p"
    .string "The POKéMON you get in trades grow\n"
    .string "quickly, too.$"


CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterFirstMeeting::
    .string "Hoho! What have we here?\p"
    .string "Those are some nice APRICORNS\n"
    .string "you've got there!\p"
    .string "Bring 'em to me and I'll turn 'em\n"
    .string "into BALLS.\p"
    .string "I'm the BALL MASTER.\p"
    .string "Been handling BALLS longer than\n"
    .string "you've been alive!\p"
    .string "Different APRICORNS make different\n"
    .string "kinds of BALLS.\p"
    .string "If you give me just one, I can\n"
    .string "finish your BALL right away.\p"
    .string "Give me more than one, though, and\n"
    .string "I'll need three days to work the\n"
    .string "whole batch.\p"
    .string "And once I've got my hands full of\n"
    .string "BALLS, I can't take any more\n"
    .string "APRICORNS until I'm finished.\p"
    .string "So remember—when you say YES, I'm\n"
    .string "taking every APRICORN you're\n"
    .string "carrying.\p"
    .string "No picking and choosing after that!\p"
    .string "Now then...\p"
    .string "You got any APRICORNS for me?$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterRepeat::
    .string "Well, well... Back for more BALLS?\p"
    .string "Do you have any APRICORNS for me?$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterNo::
    .string "No BALLS today, eh? Shame.\n"
    .string "I had both hands ready.$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterEmpty::
    .string "Eh? Nothing? You can't just tease\n"
    .string "an old man with talk of BALLS!$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterInventoryIntro::
    .string "Let's see what you've brought me...$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterInventoryLine::
    .string "{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}.$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterInventoryTotal::
    .string "That'll make {STR_VAR_1} POKé BALLS\n"
    .string "altogether!$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterSingle::
    .string "Just one? Heh. I can handle one\n"
    .string "BALL right now!\p"
    .string "Give me a second...\p"
    .string "... There we are! Nothing like a\n"
    .string "freshly finished BALL in your hands.\p"
    .string "You received a {STR_VAR_1}!$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterBatchAccepted::
    .string "Oho! Now that's a healthy set of\n"
    .string "BALLS. I'll need both hands for\n"
    .string "this one.\p"
    .string "I'll have all {STR_VAR_1} of your\n"
    .string "BALLS ready in three days.\n"
    .string "Come back then.\p"
    .string "And try not to think about what I'm\n"
    .string "doing with them in the meantime.$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterWorking3Days::
    .string "Easy there! I've only just started\n"
    .string "working these BALLS.\p"
    .string "Come back in about three days.$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterWorking2Days::
    .string "Still working on your BALLS.\n"
    .string "They're coming along nicely.\p"
    .string "About two days left.$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterWorking1Day::
    .string "Nearly there! Your BALLS just need\n"
    .string "a little more attention.\p"
    .string "About a day left.$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterWorkingHours::
    .string "Oho, you're eager to get your BALLS\n"
    .string "back! Nearly finished.\p"
    .string "About {STR_VAR_1} hours left.$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterCompleteIntro::
    .string "Ahh! Perfect timing! I've finished\n"
    .string "working your BALLS. Nice and\n"
    .string "polished, too.\p"
    .string "Let's see what we've got...$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterFinishedLine::
    .string "{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}.$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterCompleteOutro::
    .string "That's the whole lot.\n"
    .string "Take good care of your BALLS.$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterBagOnly::
    .string "There you go! All those BALLS fit\n"
    .string "snugly in your Bag.\p"
    .string "Don't spend 'em all in one place!$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterPCOverflow::
    .string "Oho! That's more BALLS than you can\n"
    .string "carry! I stuffed what I could into\n"
    .string "your Bag.\p"
    .string "The rest of your BALLS went straight\n"
    .string "to your PC. Plenty of room to keep\n"
    .string "'em safe in there.$"

CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BallMasterStorageFailure::
    .string "Whoa there! You've got too many\n"
    .string "BALLS already!\p"
    .string "There isn't enough room in your Bag\n"
    .string "or your PC for this whole batch.\p"
    .string "Make some space and come back.\n"
    .string "I'll keep a firm grip on your BALLS\n"
    .string "until then.$"
